  "notes": "{気付|きづ}く is a godan verb meaning to notice or realize something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive)\n\nPARTICLE PATTERN:\n- Xに{気付|きづ}く: to notice X, to become aware of X\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{気付|きづ}いている indicates a state of awareness: {彼|かれ}は{気付|きづ}いている (He is aware / He has noticed).\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {間違|まちが}いに{気付|きづ}く: to notice a mistake\n- {変化|へんか}に{気付|きづ}く: to notice a change\n- {大切|たいせつ}さに{気付|きづ}く: to realize the importance\n\nSIMILAR EXPRESSIONS:\n- {気|き}がつく: alternative phrasing, same meaning\n- {気付|きづ}き: realization (noun form)\n\nDON'T CONFUSE:\n- {気付|きづ}く (きづく): to notice\n- {築|きず}く (きずく): to build, construct",
